etween px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-white/5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500","children":"SKILL.md"}],["$","$L4",null,{"text":"# Debug production without stopping the world (Python)\n\n> Safe live diagnosis using flags, traces, and snapshots instead of restart roulette.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nSafe live diagnosis using flags, traces, and snapshots instead of restart roulette.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Correlate user report to trace IDs through gateway → service → data layer\n2. Capture state non-invasively: heap/profile snapshots over process restarts\n3. Enable dynamic log levels temporarily rather than redeploying\n4. Test hypotheses against staging replicas of prod data shape\n5. Timebox live debugging; mitigate via rollback/flag if past window\n6. Write postmortem linking timeline to evidence artifacts\n7. Profile with py-spy and cProfile; watch the GIL on CPU-bound paths\n8. Pin environments via lockfiles; verify wheels exist for your platforms\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Restarting away evidence mid-diagnosis\n- Debugging against sanitized data missing the trigger shape\n","label":"Copy markdown"}]]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"text-[11px] font-mono p-4 overflow-x-auto max-h-72 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"# Debug production without stopping the world (Python)\n\n> Safe live diagnosis using flags, traces, and snapshots instead of restart roulette.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nSafe live diagnosis using flags, traces, and snapshots instead of restart roulette.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Correlate user report to trace IDs through gateway → service → data layer\n2. Capture state non-invasively: heap/profile snapshots over process restarts\n3. Enable dynamic log levels temporarily rather than redeploying\n4. Test hypotheses against staging replicas of prod data shape\n5. Timebox live debugging; mitigate via rollback/flag if past window\n6. Write postmortem linking timeline to evidence artifacts\n7. Profile with py-spy and cProfile; watch the GIL on CPU-bound paths\n8. Pin environments via lockfiles; verify wheels exist for your platforms\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Restarting away evidence mid-diagnosis\n- Debugging against sanitized data missing the trigger shape\n"}]}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/aniruddhaadak80/skills/blob/main/skills/debug-craft-production-debugging-python/SKILL.md","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"block text-center px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/15 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors","children":"View source on GitHub ↗"}]]}]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"mt-16 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/skills/engineering-essentials/debug-craft-production-debugging-node","className":"card-hover group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-panel/70 p-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600","children":"← Previous"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors truncate","children":"Debug production without stopping the world (Node.js)"}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/skills/engineering-essentials/debug-craft-production-debugging-go","className":"card-hover group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-panel/70 p-4 text-right","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600","children":"Next →"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors truncate","children":"Debug production without stopping the world (Go)"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14 pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold mb-5","children":"Related skills"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"classN